{
  "about": [
    "Every key the companion library logs, as it appears in a wpilog from a real robot, and its wpilog type.",
    "{bus} is a CAN bus name (CANBus(\"*\"), any CANivore, logs as Any; the roboRIO's bus as rio); {model} is the device class (TalonFX, CANcoder, Pigeon2, ...); {id} its CAN id.",
    "Foresight joins devices to its snapshot by prefix-matching the server's Model (Talon FX vers. C is TalonFX, CANCoder vers. H is CANcoder, Pigeon 2 is Pigeon2) and mapping the snapshot's bus \"\" to rio; devices on CANBus(\"*\") log as Any, which can't be joined by bus name.",
    "Outputs log under /RealOutputs on a robot and /ReplayOutputs in a replay; inputs log at the root either way.",
    "Two tests read this file, so a renamed key fails on both sides: KeysTest.java in core and battery, and tests/companion-keys.test.ts."
  ],
